// Hana's Night Watch — Lighthouse Tales, episode 1 (placeholder spin-off).

VAR arrived = false
VAR read_signal = false

=== arrival ===
The lamp turns slowly above the island. Far out, a small light blinks back.
hana: A boat? At this hour? #surprised
-> DONE

=== boat ===
The little light blinks: long, short, short, long. Then again.
hana: Long, short, short, long. That's Tomo's old signal. He's asking for the safe channel. #worried
~ read_signal = true
-> DONE

=== lamp_unsure ===
hana: I could signal back, but I don't know what he's asking yet. #worried
-> DONE

=== dawn ===
The boat slips past the rocks as the sky turns pink.
tomo: Thought you'd forgotten the old code, keeper! #happy
hana: Never. Mira's lamp, Tomo's code. The island remembers. #happy
-> DONE
